<title>BAHRAIN: Saudi Hollandi Bank details 1996 results.</title>
<headline>Saudi Hollandi Bank details 1996 results.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>	     (million Saudi riyals unless stated)</p>
<p> Share			 38.43 riyals   vs	33.41 riyals</p>
<p> Net profit		  161.4	    vs     140.3</p>
<p> Loan loss provision	50.0	    vs	same</p>
<p> Operating income	1,117.3	    vs   1,093.1</p>
<p> Operating expenses	977.0	    vs     968.1</p>
<p> Net operating income    140.3	    vs     125.0</p>
<p> Other income		 21.1	    vs	15.3</p>
<p>Full Name: Saudi Hollandi Bank.</p>
<p>Note - The Riyadh-based bank is 40 percent held by the Dutch ABN-Amro Bank. The rest is owned by Saudi investors. ($1 = 3.75 riyals)</p>
<p>-- Manama newsroom 973-536187</p>
</text>
